00:08:22.639 --> 00:08:24.532
but I'm so appreciative for it because it

00:08:24.532 --> 00:08:26.261
kinda started us on this journey, right?

00:08:26.261 --> 00:08:28.385
Like, I look at the
last two years, how much

00:08:28.385 --> 00:08:30.469
