I've grown as a video-maker.

00:08:33.523 --> 00:08:35.209
And this is really where it all started.

00:08:35.209 --> 00:08:37.097
- I think as someone
who's never had brothers,

00:08:37.097 --> 00:08:38.963
this is the closest I've
had to having brothers.

00:08:38.963 --> 00:08:40.964
