vomited into the ocean.

00:08:47.139 --> 00:08:48.139
- Well, you vomited in it.

00:08:48.139 --> 00:08:48.972
- One of us.

00:08:48.972 --> 00:08:49.838
- Well, one of us.
- One of us did.

00:08:49.838 --> 00:08:51.418
- Okay, we did it together.

00:08:51.418 --> 00:08:52.251
(laughs)

00:08:52.251 --> 00:08:53.395
