00:08:53.395 --> 00:08:55.671
'cause people keep watchin' it, so thanks.

00:08:55.671 --> 00:08:56.520
- Thank you.

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:57.449
- Thanks, guys.

00:08:57.449 --> 00:08:58.833
- Yeah, it's really because
of the audience, right?

00:08:58.833 --> 00:08:59.666
